102 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 36 0 R
/E (The multi-variable analysis evaluated the link between load increases and frequency tracking responses. For node LON, the system calculated a Pearson Correlation Coefficient of r = 0.1545. This positive but weak correlation proves that while load shifts cause system transitions, automated compensation loops and turbine governors inject non-linear variables that decouple pure linear scaling under peak demand stress [3].)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
