173 0 obj
<<
/Title (The analytical breakdown confirmed a distinct operational split during grid anomalies, quantified by state-specific variance expansions and an asymmetric Fisher-Pearson skewness value. Integrating these data models into an automated visualization suite helps operations teams quickly isolate grid stress events to meet strict utility runtime standards. Future iterations could enhance capabilities by deploying this vectorized code structure directly onto edge terminal microcontrollers within regional substations, enabling automated hardware filtering of data anomalies before uplink transmissions to conserve network bandwidth.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 186 0 R
/Next 130 0 R
>>
